            <div class="content-text">
                
                <p><strong>ITR Forms:</strong> ITR-1 (up to Rs 50 lakh). ITR-2 (>Rs 50 lakh / capital gains / foreign assets).</p><p><strong>New Regime (S.115BAC):</strong> Default. Slabs 0-4L nil to >24L 30%. Standard Rs 75,000. S.87A Rs 60,000.</p><p><strong>Old Regime:</strong> Opt-in via ITR. All deductions: 80C, 80D, HRA, 24(b). Standard Rs 50,000.</p><p><strong>Regime Switch:</strong> Salaried without business can switch every year in ITR.</p><p><strong>Due Date:</strong> 31 July 2026. Late: Rs 5,000 + 1%/month.</p><p><strong>Form 16:</strong> S.203. By 15 June from employer.</p><p><strong>Source:</strong> <a href="https://incometax.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">incometax.gov.in</a></p>

